%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9d9823f1389b9494fb873a7bbf134a97, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ananda_Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueId: ananda_intro
  nodes:
  - nodeId: an_intro
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: Ah... a visitor. I felt your presence on the path before you arrived.
      Please, sit. You've come a long way.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7079388f3e4e46d99656c7a45c0c4f7, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_pause
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_pause
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "You carry something with you. Not in your hands \u2014 in your
      heart. I can see it in the way you move. Tell me, what brings you to this temple?"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b986e1a36bd4f47eeb112d37b836a110, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_choice1
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_choice1
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: Take your time. There is no rush here.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b417ea1cdd14477f832250a1cf03e4b, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - choiceText: A ghost told me to come here. Said you could help.
      inputLabel: Z
      nextNodeId: an_r1_neutral
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    - choiceText: I want to understand what's happening in this place. Why are the
        ghosts suffering?
      inputLabel: X
      nextNodeId: an_r1_curious
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    - choiceText: I met a spirit in pain down the hill. I want to help, but I don't
        know how.
      inputLabel: C
      nextNodeId: an_r1_empathetic
      karmaChange: 15
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 0
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      conditions: []
      actions:
      - rid: 1808434539632263318
    nextNodeId: 
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_r1_neutral
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: The old ghost sent you? Then he saw something in you worth sending.
      That alone tells me much.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ed0d66cee2c748c29c505811e13605a, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_callback_compassion
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_r1_curious
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: A question worth asking. Most who come here see the suffering and
      look away. You looked closer. That takes a certain kind of courage.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2dea21e0d7026410b8912e10a9e0e8d2, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_callback_compassion
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_r1_empathetic
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "You felt his pain and came seeking a way to ease it. That impulse
      \u2014 don't lose it. It's rarer than you know."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 82abe7f9ed5dd4505a4e0ac2863fd949, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_callback_compassion
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_callback_compassion
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "I sense you showed the old spirit compassion. That warmth you
      offered him \u2014 it rippled through this realm like a stone in still water.
      Even here, kindness echoes."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2cfd656bae6b6423e8495350780cbc39, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_callback_neutral
    isEnd: 0
    conditions:
    - rid: 1808434539632263319
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_callback_neutral
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: You listened to the old spirit with patience, neither rushing to
      comfort nor turning away. There is wisdom in simply being present. The ghosts
      here have forgotten what that feels like.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 28016dce2796a408c95e6c7ee7ff39d1, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_callback_harsh
    isEnd: 0
    conditions:
    - rid: 1808434539632263320
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_callback_harsh
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "The old spirit... he told me you were sharp with him. Don't be
      ashamed \u2014 honesty, even harsh honesty, is its own form of truth. But ask
      yourself: was it honesty, or was it armor?"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b92569e963c744addaa7ab01a96fcf9b, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_mechanic1
    isEnd: 0
    conditions:
    - rid: 1808434539632263321
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_mechanic1
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "This realm feeds on craving \u2014 on wanting what you cannot
      have and clinging to what you cannot keep. The ghosts here are trapped in that
      cycle."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 293f7cea02ee243259f8917008d9346b, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_mechanic2
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_mechanic2
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "But here's what they've forgotten: the hunger isn't the punishment.
      It's the teacher. Every pang is asking the same question \u2014 what do you
      truly need?"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a09cf6c9133834a81bc12869ac7f5779, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_choice2
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_choice2
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: What do you think? Can suffering teach us something, or is it just...
      suffering?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5615d0f0ee69648a29e83aefb24c8641, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - choiceText: Maybe both? It hurts, but sometimes that's how we learn.
      inputLabel: Z
      nextNodeId: an_r2_curious
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    - choiceText: If suffering has a lesson, I want to learn it so I can help others
        avoid it.
      inputLabel: X
      nextNodeId: an_r2_empathetic
      karmaChange: 10
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 0
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      conditions: []
      actions:
      - rid: 1808434539632263322
    - choiceText: I don't know. I just want to get through this.
      inputLabel: C
      nextNodeId: an_r2_neutral
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    nextNodeId: 
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_r2_curious
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "Both \u2014 yes. You're learning already. The pain and the wisdom
      are two sides of the same coin."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aa9c99b77ee1e43c98a230e4a0fe07de, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_mechanic3
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_r2_empathetic
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "To learn from your own suffering so that others might suffer less
      \u2014 that is the bodhisattva's path. You walk it more naturally than you
      know."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a5519274cba944ce8d0bbefd2be0d0f, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_mechanic3
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_r2_neutral
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: That honesty is a start. You don't have to understand everything
      at once. Just keep your eyes open.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4cf10791da6c42ee86dc9dfae8ff113, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_mechanic3
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_mechanic3
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "Let me teach you something. When the noise of this realm becomes
      too much \u2014 the cravings, the confusion \u2014 there is a way to find stillness."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a00d13c9818ec491292a216dfa9e463f, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_humming
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_humming
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "Close your eyes. Breathe. And hum \u2014 a low, steady tone. Feel
      it in your chest. This is how you center yourself when the world pulls at you."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 182e4974d24d445438d8b982a71d75be, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_reflection
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions:
    - rid: 1808434539632263323
  - nodeId: an_reflection
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "Good. Remember that feeling \u2014 that calm. You'll need it.
      This realm will test you in ways you don't expect. Not with monsters, but with
      choices."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e9585230ac9e545ec850dd1c09fd190a, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_choice3
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_choice3
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "Before you go further, tell me \u2014 when you face a difficult
      choice, what guides you?"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c3d16d38916564692bd138e2c81fb9a7, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - choiceText: I try to think about what's fair for everyone.
      inputLabel: Z
      nextNodeId: an_r3_neutral
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    - choiceText: My heart. I feel what the right thing is, even when it's hard.
      inputLabel: X
      nextNodeId: an_r3_empathetic
      karmaChange: 15
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 0
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      conditions: []
      actions:
      - rid: 1808434539632263324
    - choiceText: I'm curious to see what happens. Every choice reveals something.
      inputLabel: C
      nextNodeId: an_r3_curious
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 2
      voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    nextNodeId: 
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_r3_neutral
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "Fairness \u2014 a noble compass. But remember: what seems fair
      on the surface may not address the deeper need. Look beyond the obvious."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d98f657be30b84b6dbbe01ad4ebba165, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_quest_complete
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_r3_empathetic
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "The heart knows what the mind argues against. Trust that voice,
      Sammy. It will not lead you astray \u2014 even when the path it shows is the
      harder one."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d654fbb99d07404c959ca832cfd1850, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_quest_complete
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_r3_curious
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "A seeker! Yes \u2014 curiosity is the first step on every worthy
      path. Just be mindful that seeking doesn't become avoiding. Sometimes you must
      choose, not just observe."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6bc47700ec90b4c7a8fb47f820969cc7, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_quest_complete
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_quest_complete
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: You found me, just as the old spirit hoped. Your first journey
      in this realm is complete. But the real test is only beginning.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fcc04ec539245458396337b2efc5012a, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_bread_give
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions:
    - rid: 1808434539632263325
    - rid: 1808434539632263326
  - nodeId: an_bread_give
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "Here \u2014 take this bread. I baked it this morning. It's warm,
      and it will fill your belly."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 542284db36c414170bad9e06241b2645, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_bread_explain
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions:
    - rid: 1808434539632263327
    - rid: 1808434539632263328
  - nodeId: an_bread_explain
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "But Sammy \u2014 pay attention as you walk. You may find that
      you aren't the hungriest person on this path. When that moment comes, listen
      to what your heart tells you."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fbbca22cb8e414936b7bee3f46875d18, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_player_thought1
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_player_thought1
    speakerName: Sammy
    dialogueText: "(The bread is warm in my hands. It smells like home \u2014 like
      something I'd almost forgotten.)"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_player_thought2
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_player_thought2
    speakerName: Sammy
    dialogueText: (Ananda said to pay attention. To notice when someone needs this
      more than I do. I wonder what he means...)
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_quest_hunger
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: an_quest_hunger
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "Now go. Walk the path ahead and observe \u2014 not just the world
      around you, but the world within you. We will meet again."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4c990061035b64206ba74112e8f96380, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: an_final
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions:
    - rid: 1808434539632263329
  - nodeId: an_final
    speakerName: Ananda
    dialogueText: "May your steps be mindful, Sammy. And remember \u2014 the humming.
      It will bring you back to yourself when you need it most."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40bdb181a893747ef95af40c89080be8, type: 3}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
    isEnd: 1
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
